  "description": "No sooner does Senator Amidala arrive on Coruscant than an explosive assassination attempt is made, killing a valiant decoy for the senator instead. Before long a second effort to murder Amidala is underway, but the extraordinary protection of Jedi knights Anakin Skywalker and his mentor-master, Obi-Wan Kenobi, prevents this. A wild chase across the surface of city-planet Coruscant ensues, and the capture of bounty hunter Zam Wesell is complicated when Wesell herself is killed by a mysterious, saberdart-shooting \"rocket man.\" Obi-Wan remains on Coruscant for further investigation, while Amidala and the long-smitten Skywalker, her Jedi bodyguard, head back to Naboo..."
